        {
          "title": "Download latest WinTAK installation file",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Download WinTAK from the Deploy app</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Download latest WinTAK Plugin",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Download at least Data Sync plugin</li>\n<li>Download other needed plugins from here</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Check / Change Windows area settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>WinTAK REQUIRES that Windows area settings are defined to United States</li>\n<li>Language settings can be your preferred language</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/334e768198ca3b4b.webp",
              "width": 1019,
              "height": 645
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Install the WinTAK",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Go to the folder where you downloaded the WinTAK installation file</li>\n<li>Start the installation and install the WinTAK</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "1. Open WinTAK",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>After installation, find the WinTAK icon and open the application</li>\n</ul>",
