        {
          "title": "18. NO GPS",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Most PCs don't have their own GPS chip, so the user has to set their location manually.</li>\n<li>To set location manually tap the \"NO GPS\" window</li>\n</ul>",
